lib/API/Docker/Secret.pm and lib/API/Docker/Config.pm both 'has CreatedAt' and 'has UpdatedAt' (line ~81-82 / ~85-86) with no =attr block for either -- every other attribute in both classes (client, ID, Spec, Version) is documented. lib/API/Docker/Plugin.pm, the third new entity class from this same round, documents all seven of its fields including the equivalent timestamp-shaped ones, so this is an inconsistency within the round rather than a pre-existing gap. Found during release audit (POD-vs-code sweep of the three new entity classes). Fix: add =attr CreatedAt / =attr UpdatedAt to both files, matching Plugin.pm's style.
